### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 74/100.** Evidence TB Lite ~68%; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 74/100.** Evidence LiveBench Lite ~70%; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 96/100.** 1,048,576 (1M) — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 88/100.** Text, image, audio, PDF in; text out; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 74/100.** Evidence LiveCode 80.12% #71 Lite; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 85/100.** $0.40/$1.60 per 1M Lite.
- **Overall Score: 81/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (74+74+96+88+74)/5=81.2 → 81; best-fit per scoring methodology.

